#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:1
msgid "根据给定的标的、数据类型与频率，从本地数据源获取历史数据并组装为策略可直接使用的结构。"
msgstr ""
"Given the specified instruments, data types, and frequency, fetch historical"
" data from the local data source and assemble it into a structure that can "
"be used directly by the strategy."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:3
msgid ""
"本入口只接受 ``kind=history``（时间 × 标的）的数据类型。宏观/基准请用 "
"``get_reference_data``，证券属性截面请用 ``get_static_data``；错形状会以英文错误 指向正确入口。可以通过 "
"``htype_names`` 或 ``data_types`` 指定需要的数据种类，并结合 ``shares`` / "
"``symbols``、时间区间与 ``freq`` 控制取数范围；根据 ``as_data_frame`` 与 ``group_by`` "
"的设置，函数返回 HistoryPanel 或按标的/数据类型分组的 DataFrame 字典。 关于数据类型推断、频率转换和 "
"trade_time_only 等高级用法，详见文档「历史数据获取 get_history_data」相关章节。"
msgstr ""
"This entrance only accepts ``kind=history``（时间 × 标的）的数据类型。宏观/基准请用 "
"``get_reference_data``，证券属性截面请用 ``get_static_data``；错形状会以英文错误 指向正确入口。可以通过 "
"``htype_names`` 或 ``data_types`` 指定需要的数据种类，并结合 `⟦ CODE10⟧` / "
"``symbols``、时间区间与 ``freq`` 控制取数范围；根据 ``as_data_frame`` 与 ``group_by`` "
"setting, the function returns HistoryPanel or a dictionary of DataFrames "
"grouped by target/data type. For advanced usage such as data type inference,"
" frequency conversion and trade_time_only, please refer to the relevant "
"chapters of the document \"Get_history_data\" for details."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:11
msgid ""
"需要获取的历史数据名称集合；可为逗号分隔字符串（如 ``'open, high, low, close'``） 或列表（如 ``['open', "
"'high', 'low', 'close']``）。若为空，系统会结合 ``freq`` / ``asset_type`` 等参数推断可用的 "
"htypes。"
msgstr ""
"Collection of historical data names to retrieve; can be a comma-separated "
"string (e.g., ``'open, high, low, close'``) or a list (e.g., ``['open', "
"'high', 'low', 'close']``). If empty, the system will infer available htypes"
" based on parameters such as ``freq`` / ``asset_type``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:15
msgid ""
"历史数据类型对象列表；语义与 ``htype_names`` 类似，优先使用 ``htype_names`` / ``data_types`` 新接口。"
msgstr ""
"List of historical data type objects; semantics are similar to "
"``htype_names``. Prefer the new ``htype_names`` / ``data_types`` interface."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:18
msgid ""
"需要获取的历史数据类型集合，必须是合法的数据类型对象。 "
"如果给出了本参数，htype_names会被忽略，否则根据htype_names参数创建可能的htypes"
msgstr ""
"The set of historical data types to be obtained, must be a legal data type "
"object. If this parameter is given, htype_names will be ignored, otherwise "
"possible htypes will be created based on the htype_names parameter"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:21
msgid "需要获取历史数据的数据源"
msgstr "Data source to obtain historical data"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:23
msgid ""
"证券代码集合；可为逗号分隔字符串（如 ``'000001.SZ, 000002.SZ'``）或列表 （如 ``['000001.SZ', "
"'000002.SZ']``）。"
msgstr ""
"Collection of security codes; can be a comma-separated string (e.g., "
"``'000001.SZ, 000002.SZ'``) or a list (e.g., ``['000001.SZ', "
"'000002.SZ']``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:26
msgid ""
"证券代码集合；可为逗号分隔字符串（如 ``'000001, 000002'``）或列表 （如 ``['000001', '000002']``）。"
msgstr ""
"Collection of security codes; can be a comma-separated string (e.g., "
"``'000001, 000002'``) or a list (e.g., ``['000001', '000002']``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:29
msgid "YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS 格式的日期/时间，获取的历史数据的开始日期/时间(如果可用)"
msgstr ""
"YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS format date/time, start date/time of historical data to be"
" obtained (if available)"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:31
msgid "YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS 格式的日期/时间，获取的历史数据的结束日期/时间(如果可用)"
msgstr ""
"YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS format date/time, end date/time of historical data to be "
"obtained (if available)"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:33
msgid ""
"获取的历史数据的行数，如果指定了start和end，则忽略此参数，且获取的数据的时间范围为[start, end] "
"如果未指定start和end，则获取数据表中最近的rows条数据，使用row来获取数据时，速度比使用日期慢得多"
msgstr ""
"Number of rows of historical data to be obtained. If start and end are "
"specified, this parameter is ignored, and the time range of the obtained "
"data is [start, end]. If start and end are not specified, the most recent "
"rows of data in the data table will be obtained. Using row to obtain data is"
" much slower than using date"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:36
msgid ""
"频率；支持 ``1min``/``5min``/``15min``/``30min`` 等分钟周期，以及 ``H``/``D``/``W``/``M``"
" 等小时/日/周/月周期（如 K 线）。"
msgstr ""
"Frequency; supports minute intervals such as "
"``1min``/``5min``/``15min``/``30min``, as well as "
"hourly/daily/weekly/monthly intervals such as ``H``/``D``/``W``/``M`` (e.g.,"
" candlesticks)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:39
msgid ""
"资产类型过滤；可用逗号分隔字符串（如 ``'E, IDX'``）或列表（如 ``['E', 'IDX']``）。 常见取值包括 "
"``any``、``E``、``IDX``、``FT``、``FD`` 等。"
msgstr ""
"Asset type filter; can be a comma-separated string (e.g. ``'E, IDX'``) or a "
"list (e.g. ``['E', 'IDX']``). Common values include ``any``, ``E``, ``IDX``,"
" ``FT``, ``FD``, etc."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:42
msgid ""
"已弃用的复权选项（``none``/``n``、``back``/``b``、``forward``/``fw``/``f``）。 新代码请在 "
"htype 中显式使用复权列名（如 ``close|b``）。"
msgstr ""
"Deprecated adjustment options (``none``/``n``, ``back``/``b``, "
"``forward``/``fw``/``f``). For new code, explicitly use the adjusted column "
"name in htype (e.g. ``close|b``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:45
msgid ""
"``True``（默认）时返回按 ``group_by`` 分组的 ``DataFrame`` 字典； ``False`` 时返回 "
"``HistoryPanel``。"
msgstr ""
"``True``（默认）时返回按 ``group_by`` 分组的 ``DataFrame`` 字典； ``False`` 时返回 "
"``HistoryPanel``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:48
msgid ""
"返回 DataFrame 字典时的分组键；常用 ``'shares'``/``'share'``/``'s'`` 或 "
"``'htypes'``/``'htype'``/``'h'``。"
msgstr ""
"Grouping key when returning a dict of DataFrames; commonly "
"``'shares'``/``'share'``/``'s'`` or ``'htypes'``/``'htype'``/``'h'``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:51
msgid ""
"透传给底层取数/频率转换的附加参数（如 ``drop_nan``、``resample_method`` 等）。 详细可选值与语义见文档「历史数据获取 "
"get_history_data」及 ``infer_data_types`` 说明。"
msgstr ""
"Additional parameters passed through to the underlying data retrieval / "
"frequency conversion (e.g. ``drop_nan``, ``resample_method``, etc.). For "
"detailed available values and semantics, see the documentation “Historical "
"Data Retrieval get_history_data” and the ``infer_data_types`` notes."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:54
msgid ""
"* *HistoryPanel* -- 当 ``as_data_frame`` 为 False 时，返回包含所有请求数据的 HistoryPanel "
"对象。 * *dict of pandas.DataFrame* -- 当 ``as_data_frame`` 为 True 时，返回按 "
"``group_by`` 分组的 DataFrame 字典。"
msgstr ""
"* *HistoryPanel* -- When ``as_data_frame`` is False, returns a HistoryPanel "
"object containing all requested data. * *dict of pandas.DataFrame* -- When "
"``as_data_frame`` is True, returns a dict of DataFrames grouped by "
"``group_by``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:54
msgid ""
"*HistoryPanel* -- 当 ``as_data_frame`` 为 False 时，返回包含所有请求数据的 HistoryPanel 对象。"
msgstr ""
"*HistoryPanel* -- When ``as_data_frame`` is False, returns a HistoryPanel "
"object containing all requested data."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:55
msgid ""
"*dict of pandas.DataFrame* -- 当 ``as_data_frame`` 为 True 时，返回按 ``group_by`` "
"分组的 DataFrame 字典。"
msgstr ""
"*dict of pandas.DataFrame* -- When ``as_data_frame`` is True, returns a dict"
" of DataFrames grouped by ``group_by``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:1
msgid "从本地数据源获取 Reference（仅时间维）数据，返回 ``dict[str, Series]``。"
msgstr ""
"Get Reference (time dimension only) data from local data source and return "
"``dict[str, Series]``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:3
msgid ""
"同时接受原生 Reference（如 ``cn_gdp``、``north_money``）与 unsymbolizer （如 "
"``close-000300.SH`` / ``close-000300.SH_IDX_d``）。不需要 ``shares``： "
"宏观数据本身无标的维，基准代码已编码在 unsymbolizer ID 中。 更多使用细节见文档「数据类型 DataType」与 S1.5 消费契约。"
msgstr ""
"Also accept native Reference (such as ``cn_gdp``、``north_money``）与 "
"unsymbolizer （如 ``close-000300.SH`` / ``close-000300.SH_IDX_d``）。不需要 "
"``shares``: The macro data itself has unstandardized dimensions, and the "
"reference code has been encoded in the unsymbolizer ID. For more usage "
"details, see the document \"Data Type DataType\" and S1.5 consumption "
"contract."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:8
msgid "参考数据名称；逗号分隔字符串或列表。可为宽名、完整 id 或 unsymbolizer 名。"
msgstr ""
"Reference data names; comma-separated string or list. Can be a wide name, "
"full id, or unsymbolizer name."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:10 qteasy.core.get_static_data:14
msgid "显式 DataType 列表；若给出则忽略 ``names``。"
msgstr "Explicit DataType list; ``names`` is ignored if given."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:12 qteasy.core.get_static_data:16
msgid "数据源；默认使用全局 ``QT_DATA_SOURCE``。"
msgstr "Data source; defaults to global ``QT_DATA_SOURCE``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:14
msgid "开始日期/时间（``YYYYMMDD`` 等可解析格式）。"
msgstr "Start date/time (parseable format such as ``YYYYMMDD``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:16
msgid "结束日期/时间。"
msgstr "End date/time."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:18
msgid "目标频率；宽名消歧或与内置频率不一致时用于升/降频。"
msgstr ""
"Target frequency; used for up/down frequency when wide name disambiguation "
"or inconsistent with built-in frequency."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:20
msgid "资产类型过滤；unsymbolizer 宽名歧义时用于消歧（如 ``IDX``）。"
msgstr ""
"Asset type filtering; unsymbolizer is used to disambiguate wide name "
"ambiguities (such as ``IDX``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:22
msgid "最近行数；与 ``start``/``end`` 同时给出时以日期区间为准。"
msgstr ""
"The number of recent rows; when given together with ``start``/``end``, the "
"date range shall prevail."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:25
msgid "键为完整 ``dtype_id``，值为 index=时间的 Series。"
msgstr ""
"The key is the complete ``dtype_id`` and the value is a Series with "
"index=time."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:28
msgid "名称为 history/static，或无法解析为合法 Reference。"
msgstr ""
"The name is history/static, or cannot be resolved to a legal Reference."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:29 qteasy.core.get_static_data:26
msgid "参数类型错误。"
msgstr "Parameter type is wrong."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:1
msgid "从本地数据源获取 Static（仅标的维）截面数据。"
msgstr ""
"Gets Static (subject dimension only) cross-section data from a local data "
"source."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:3
msgid ""
"用于行业、上市日、证券名称等与时间无关的属性。返回以 ``qt_code`` 为索引的 ``Series``（单个名称）或 "
"``DataFrame``（多个名称）；不升频、不编入 HistoryPanel。 更多使用细节见文档「数据类型 DataType」与 S1.5 "
"消费契约。"
msgstr ""
"Used for time-independent attributes such as industry, listing date, "
"security name, etc. Returns as ``qt_code`` 为索引的 ``Series``（单个名称）或 "
"``DataFrame`` (multiple names); no upscaling, no programming into "
"HistoryPanel. For more usage details, see the document \"Data Type "
"DataType\" and S1.5 consumption contract."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:7
msgid "静态数据类型名称；逗号分隔字符串或列表。可为宽名或完整 id （如 ``industry``、``list_date_E_None``）。"
msgstr ""
"Static data type name; comma-separated string or list. Can be a wide name or"
" a full id (e.g. ``industry``、``list_date_E_None``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:10
msgid "证券代码池；逗号分隔字符串或列表。与 ``symbols`` 二选一，至少提供一个。"
msgstr ""
"Pool of security symbols; comma-separated string or list. Choose between "
"``symbols`` and provide at least one."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:12
msgid "``shares`` 的别名。"
msgstr "Alias ​​for ``shares``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:18
msgid "资产类型消歧（如 ``E``）。宽名在多资产下歧义时必须给出 （例如 ``list_date`` 有 E/IDX/FD 等多个版本）。"
msgstr ""
"Asset type disambiguation (e.g. ``E``）。宽名在多资产下歧义时必须给出 （例如 ``list_date`` has "
"multiple versions such as E/IDX/FD etc.)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:22
msgid ""
"* *pandas.Series* -- 仅请求一个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``，值为该属性。 * "
"*pandas.DataFrame* -- 请求多个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``，列为各属性宽名。"
msgstr ""
"* *pandas.Series* -- When only one name is requested, the index is "
"``qt_code``，值为该属性。 * *pandas.DataFrame* -- 请求多个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``, "
"which is listed as the wide name of each attribute."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:22
msgid "*pandas.Series* -- 仅请求一个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``，值为该属性。"
msgstr ""
"*pandas.Series* -- When only one name is requested, index is ``qt_code`` and"
" the value is this property."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:23
msgid "*pandas.DataFrame* -- 请求多个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``，列为各属性宽名。"
msgstr ""
"*pandas.DataFrame* -- When multiple names are requested, the index is "
"``qt_code``, and the columns are the wide names of each attribute."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:25
msgid "名称为 history/reference，缺少股票池，或无法解析为合法 Static。"
msgstr ""
"Name is history/reference, stock pool is missing, or cannot be resolved to a"
" legal Static."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:1
msgid "获取指定标的的标准 OHLCV K 线数据。"
msgstr "Get the standard OHLCV K-line data of the specified target."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:3
msgid ""
"本函数是基于 DataType / get_history_data 的高层封装，用于一行代码获取常见 K 线价格数据，统一输出列名为 ``open, "
"high, low, close, vol``，便于在 Notebook 中进行快速数据探索与可视化。"
msgstr ""
"This function is a high-level encapsulation based on "
"DataType/get_history_data. It is used to obtain common K-line price data "
"with one line of code. The unified output column name is ``open, high, low, "
"close, vol``, which facilitates rapid data exploration and visualization in "
"Notebook."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:7
msgid ""
"需要获取 K 线数据的证券代码，可以是逗号分隔的字符串或字符串列表，例如： ``'000001.SZ,000002.SZ'`` 或 "
"``['000001.SZ', '000002.SZ']``。"
msgstr ""
"The security code for which K-line data needs to be obtained can be a comma-"
"separated string or a list of strings, for example: "
"``'000001.SZ,000002.SZ'`` 或 ``['000001.SZ', '000002.SZ']``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:10
msgid ""
"起始日期，格式 ``YYYYMMDD`` 或 ``YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS``。与 ``end`` 一起 指定时间区间；如给出，则 "
"``rows`` 参数被忽略。"
msgstr ""
"Starting date, format ``YYYYMMDD`` 或 ``YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS``。与 ``end`` 一起 "
"指定时间区间；如给出，则 ``rows`` The parameter is ignored."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:13
msgid "结束日期，格式同 ``start``。"
msgstr "End date, the format is the same as ``start``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:15
msgid "需要获取的最近记录条数；仅在未指定 ``start`` 和 ``end`` 时生效。"
msgstr ""
"The number of recent records to be obtained; only effective when ``start`` 和"
" ``end`` is not specified."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:17
msgid ""
"数据频率，默认为日线。可选值与 ``get_history_data`` 一致，如 ``'d'``、 ``'w'``、``'m'``、``'h'`` "
"等。"
msgstr ""
"Data frequency, default is daily line. Optional values ​​are the same as "
"``get_history_data`` 一致，如 ``'d'``、 ``'w'``、``'m'``、``'h'`` etc."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:20
msgid ""
"复权方式，语义与 ``get_history_data`` 保持一致；推荐在 DataType 名称中使 用 ``close|b`` "
"一类语法指定复权，本参数将在未来版本中移除。"
msgstr ""
"The right restoration method has the same semantics as ``get_history_data`` "
"保持一致；推荐在 DataType 名称中使 用 ``close|b`` to specify the right restoration. This "
"parameter will be removed in future versions."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:23
msgid ""
"资产类型过滤条件，如 ``'E'``（股票）、``'IDX'``（指数）等，具体含义与 ``get_history_data`` 中的 "
"``asset_type`` 参数一致。"
msgstr ""
"The asset type filter conditions, such as ``'E'``（股票）、``'IDX'``（指数）等，具体含义与 "
"``get_history_data`` 中的 ``asset_type``, have the same parameters."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:26
msgid ""
"- False: 返回单标的 DataFrame 或多标的 ``Dict[str, DataFrame]``； - True:  返回一个 "
"``HistoryPanel``，``htypes`` 固定为   ``['open', 'high', 'low', 'close', "
"'vol']``。"
msgstr ""
"- False: Returns a single-script DataFrame or a multi-script ``Dict[str, "
"DataFrame]``； - True:  返回一个 ``HistoryPanel``，``htypes`` 固定为   ``['open', "
"'high', 'low', 'close', 'vol']``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:27
msgid "False: 返回单标的 DataFrame 或多标的 ``Dict[str, DataFrame]``；"
msgstr ""
"False: Returns a single-standard DataFrame or a multi-standard ``Dict[str, "
"DataFrame]``;"

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:28
msgid ""
"True:  返回一个 ``HistoryPanel``，``htypes`` 固定为 ``['open', 'high', 'low', "
"'close', 'vol']``。"
msgstr ""
"True: Returns a ``HistoryPanel``，``htypes`` 固定为 ``['open', 'high', 'low', "
"'close', 'vol']``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:31
msgid "历史数据源，不提供时使用全局默认 ``QT_DATA_SOURCE``。"
msgstr ""
"Historical data source, if not provided, the global default "
"``QT_DATA_SOURCE`` will be used."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:33
msgid "是否将自然日频率转换为工作日，传递给 ``get_history_data``，语义一致。"
msgstr ""
"Whether to convert natural day frequency to working day, passed to "
"``get_history_data``, the semantics are consistent."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:35
msgid "是否仅在交易时段生成时间索引，传递给 ``get_history_data``，语义一致。"
msgstr ""
"Whether to generate time index only during trading hours, passed to "
"``get_history_data``, the semantics are consistent."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:37
msgid ""
"其他将透传给 ``get_history_data`` 的参数（如 ``drop_nan``、``resample_method``、 "
"交易时段参数等）。"
msgstr ""
"Others will be transparently passed to ``get_history_data`` 的参数（如 "
"``drop_nan``、``resample_method``, trading session parameters, etc.)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:40
msgid ""
"- 当 ``as_panel=False`` 且 ``shares`` 为单个标的时，返回一个以时间为索引、   列为 ``open, high, "
"low, close, vol`` 的 DataFrame； - 当 ``as_panel=False`` 且 ``shares`` 为多个标的时，返回"
"   ``Dict[str, DataFrame]``，每只标的一张 K 线表； - 当 ``as_panel=True`` 时，返回一个 "
"``HistoryPanel``。"
msgstr ""
"- when ``as_panel=False`` 且 ``shares`` 为单个标的时，返回一个以时间为索引、   列为 ``open, high,"
" low, close, vol`` 的 DataFrame； - 当 ``as_panel=False`⟦CODE7 ⟧`shares`` "
"为多个标的时，返回   ``Dict[str, DataFrame]``，每只标的一张 K 线表； - 当 ``as_panel=True`` "
"时，返回一个 ``HistoryPanel``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:42
msgid ""
"当 ``as_panel=False`` 且 ``shares`` 为单个标的时，返回一个以时间为索引、 列为 ``open, high, low, "
"close, vol`` 的 DataFrame；"
msgstr ""
"When the DataFrame of ``as_panel=False`` 且 ``shares`` 为单个标的时，返回一个以时间为索引、 列为 "
"``open, high, low, close, vol``;"

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:44
msgid ""
"当 ``as_panel=False`` 且 ``shares`` 为多个标的时，返回 ``Dict[str, DataFrame]``，每只标的一张 "
"K 线表；"
msgstr ""
"When ``as_panel=False`` 且 ``shares`` 为多个标的时，返回 ``Dict[str, DataFrame]``, "
"each target has a K-line table;"

#: of qteasy.core.get_kline:46
msgid "当 ``as_panel=True`` 时，返回一个 ``HistoryPanel``。"
msgstr "When ``as_panel=True`` 时，返回一个 ``HistoryPanel``."

